{{JPExclusive}}
'''Nana & Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by completing any stage in [[Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Collaboration Event#Kaohsiung Metro Red Line|Kaohsiung Metro Red Line]] during the [[Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 11.1 Update|Version 11.1]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 638
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Nana & Cat
|name2 = Nana & Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Nana & Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Nana & Cat is a decent choice as an anti-[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] crowd-controller early in the game, as her guaranteed Mini-Waves allow her to affect large groups of Dark enemies with her Slow, although due to her low uptime, it will take a decent stack of them to maintain the effect. Fortunately, her range is just high enough to keep her away from hordes of [[Gory Dark]] and [[Shadow Boxer K|Shadow Boxer K.]], and the pseudo-Area Attack granted by these Mini-Waves gives her a huge advantage over other options at that point like [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Cat Gunslinger]].

However, this is the only area of the game she remains useful. Her reliance on stacking soon becomes a much more noticeable flaw as larger swarms of enemies lower the effectiveness of one's meatshields, and once [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] is obtained, Nana quickly loses relevance in any form, as the former is better in just about every way.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

